# Aurora — the wide unison pad: every note claims two detuned sawtooth
# cards, each card its own circuit, fanned hard across the field, with a
# quiet octave above to catch the light. The filter sits open and lets the
# ensemble beat; the release blooms into a long, bright-edged room.
